{"url": "https://webaim.org/services/certification/", "silo": "webaim", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n\t\t<title>WebAIM: Accessible Website Certification</title>\n\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/media/favicon.ico\">\n\t<link rel=\"home\" href=\"/\">\n\t<link rel=\"search\" href=\"/search/\">\n\t<link rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://webaim.org/blog/feed\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"WebAIM Blog\">\n\n\t<script async=\"\" src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-Y41PF8WV9X\"></script>\n\t<script>\n  \twindow.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n  \tfunction gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n  \tgtag('js', new Date());\n  \tgtag('config', 'G-Y41PF8WV9X');\n\t</script>\n\t\n\t<link href=\"/styles/main.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"/styles/print.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"print\">\n\t<script src=\"/media/scripts/jquery.js\"></script>\n\t<script src=\"/media/scripts/main.js\"></script>\n\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:400\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Kameron:400,700\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"/styles/documents.css?ver=2\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\t\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Open+Sans:400,400i,700\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<!--[if lt IE 9]>\n\t<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://html5shiv.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/html5.js\"></script>\n<![endif]-->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async=\"\" src=\"https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net/pagead/viewthroughconversion/1069381703/?random=1774685953629&amp;cv=11&amp;fst=1774685953629&amp;bg=ffffff&amp;guid=ON&amp;async=1&amp;en=gtag.config&amp;gtm=45je63q0h2v899903185za200zd899903185xec&amp;gcd=13l3l3l3l1l1&amp;dma=0&amp;tag_exp=0~115616986~115938465~115938469~117484252~117884344~118128923&amp;u_w=1080&amp;u_h=600&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwebaim.org%2Fservices%2Fcertification%2F&amp;frm=0&amp;tiba=WebAIM%3A%20Accessible%20Website%20Certification&amp;hn=www.googleadservices.com&amp;npa=0&amp;pscdl=noapi&amp;auid=301195456.1774685902&amp;uaa=x86&amp;uab=64&amp;uafvl=Chromium%3B145.0.7632.6%7CNot%253AA-Brand%3B99.0.0.0&amp;uamb=0&amp;uam=&amp;uap=Linux&amp;uapv=&amp;uaw=0&amp;data=event%3Dgtag.config&amp;rfmt=3&amp;fmt=4\"></script></head>\n<body>\n\n\n<div id=\"headcontainer\" class=\"clearfix\" style=\"background-image: url(/media/banners/services.jpg)\">\n<header>\n\t<div id=\"skiptocontent\"><a href=\"#maincontent\">skip to main content</a></div>\n\t\n\t<h2><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\" alt=\"WebAIM - Web Accessibility In Mind\"></a></h2>\n\n\t<nav>\n\t\t<h2 class=\"hidden\">Main Navigation</h2>\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/articles/\">Articles</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/community/\">Community</a></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t</nav>\n\t<div id=\"search\">\n\t\t<form method=\"get\" role=\"search\" action=\"/search/\" id=\"sitesearch\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"search\"><span><label for=\"q\">Search:</label> <input type=\"text\" name=\"q\" id=\"q\"><input type=\"image\" src=\"/media/template/search.svg\" alt=\"Submit Search\"></span></p>\n\t\t</form>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"intro\"><a href=\"/intro\">Introduction to Web Accessibility</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"training\"><a href=\"/services/training\">WebAIM Training</a></p>\n\t</div>\n\n</header>\n</div>\n\n<main id=\"maincontainer\" class=\"clearfix\">\n\n<article id=\"maincontent\">\n\n<h1>Accessible Website Certification</h1>\n\n\t<div class=\"section\">\n\t\t<p id=\"intro\">WebAIM can provide a wide variety of accessibility services, including <a href=\"/services/consulting/\">strategic consultation</a>, <a href=\"/services/training\">training</a>, <a href=\"/services/evaluation/\">hands-on website evaluation</a>,  <a href=\"//wave.webaim.org/aim\">automated site scanning</a>, and more... all tailored to the unique needs of the organization.</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<h2 id=\"what\">What is Certification?</h2>\n\t\t<p>Upon verification that your site does not pose substantive barriers to users with disabilities, WebAIM can publish a statement on webaim.org indicating the substantial conformance of your website to WCAG on a specific date.</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p><a href=\"../certification/example\">Here's an example</a>.</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<h2 id=\"howmuch\">How much does it cost?</h2>\n\t\t<p>There is no cost for the conformance statement itself; it is included as part of a larger evaluation engagement.</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<h2 id=\"standard\">What standard do you use when evaluating a website?</h2>\n\t\t<p>The <a href=\"/standards/wcag/checklist\">Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG)</a> are primarily the basis for our evaluations. We will also document other accessibility issues not defined in the guidelines. If your organization is either part of, or does business with, the U.S. government, then we can verify that your site substantially conforms with Section 508 of the Rehabilitation Act. Many other countries or states in the U.S. have laws regarding accessibility which we can evaluate to. WebAIM can even help you create your own accessibility policy to which we can help you attain conformance. Conformance statements are valid for two years.</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<h2 id=\"vpat\">Is this the same as a VPAT?</h2>\n\t\t<p>Government agencies often require a VPAT (Voluntary Product Accessibility Template) that documents your product's conformance with Section 508. Our conformance statements and evaluation reports also can document substantial conformance, but they do not take the place of a VPAT. WebAIM can, however, help you author a VPAT.</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<h2 id=\"problems\">What if my site starts to have accessibility problems?</h2>\n\t\t<p>WebAIM can re-evaluate your website update your conformance statement. This can be done upon your request or at regular intervals. We can also show you <a href=\"/training/strategica11y/custom\">how to embed accessibility into your regular processes</a>.</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"more\"><a href=\"/contact/?subject=WebAIM%20conformance%20statement\">Contact WebAIM about obtaining a conformance statement for your website.</a></p>\n\t</div>\n\n</article>\n<!--\n\t-->\n<aside id=\"articlemeta\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"related\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Related Resources</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/services/\">WebAIM Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/services/consulting/\">Consulting &amp; Technical Assistance</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/services/monitoring/\">Site Evaluation and Reporting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/services/training/\">WebAIM Training</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n</aside>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n\t<div id=\"footerresources\">\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"copyright\">\u00a92026 WebAIM</h2>\n\t\t\t<p id=\"contact\">\t\t\tUtah State University<br>\n\t\t\t6807 Old Main Hill<br>\n\t\t\tLogan, UT 84322-6807<br>\n\t\t\t<a class=\"phone\" href=\"tel:4357977024\">435.797.7024</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div id=\"checkpage\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Check Your Accessibility</h2>\n\t\t\t<form action=\"https://wave.webaim.org/report\" novalidate=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<label for=\"waveurl\">Web site address:</label>\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"url\" id=\"waveurl\" name=\"url\" title=\"Web site address\">\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"submit\" value=\"WAVE\">\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"blog\">From the Blog</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul><li><a href=\"/blog/a-new-path/\">A New Path for Digital Accessibility?</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/2026-predictions/\">2026 Predictions: The Next Big Shifts in Web Accessibility</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/word-and-powerpoint-alt-text-roundup/\">Word and PowerPoint Alt Text Roundup</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/accessibility-by-design/\">Accessibility by Design: Preparing K\u201312 Schools for What\u2019s Next</a></li></ul>\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"popular\">Popular Resources</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/services/training/\">WebAIM Training</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/standards/wcag/checklist\">WCAG 2 Checklist</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/newsletter\">WebAIM Monthly Newsletter</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resources/contrastchecker\">Color Contrast Checker</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resources/designers/\">Web Accessibility for Designers</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"http://wave.webaim.org/\">WAVE Web Accessibility Evaluation Tool</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div id=\"footerlinks\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a id=\"footercontact\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a id=\"footerabout\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a id=\"footerrss\" href=\"/community/rss\">RSS Feeds</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a id=\"footerli\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/webaim/\">LinkedIn</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a id=\"footercopyright\" href=\"/copyright\">Copyright &amp; Terms of Use</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\t</div>\n\n</footer>\n\n\n<flying-focus id=\"flying-focus\" style=\"transition-duration: 0.1s;\"></flying-focus></body></html>", "links": [{"href": "https://webaim.org/services/certification/", "text": "skip to main content", "title": "", "base_domain": "webaim.org", "head_data": null, "head_extraction_status": null, "head_extraction_error": null, "intrinsic_score": 0.0, "contextual_score": null, "total_score": null}, {"href": "https://webaim.org/", "text": "", "title": "", "base_domain": "webaim.org", "head_data": null, "head_extraction_status": null, "head_extraction_error": null, "intrinsic_score": 0.0, "contextual_score": null, "tot